<refmeta>
<refentrytitle
><command
>kjs</command
></refentrytitle>
<manvolnum
>1</manvolnum>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
<refname
><command
>kjs</command
></refname>
<refpurpose
>Intérprete compatíbel con ECMAScript de &kde;</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<title
>Resumo</title>

<cmdsynopsis
><command
>kjs</command
> <group
> <arg choice="opt"
>--help</arg
> <arg choice="opt"
>-help</arg
> <arg choice="opt"
>-h</arg
> </group
> <group
> <arg choice="opt"
>-e<replaceable
> sentenza</replaceable
></arg
> </group
> <group
> <arg choice="plain"
><replaceable
>script</replaceable
></arg
> </group
> </cmdsynopsis>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsect1>
<title
>Descrición</title>

<para
><command
>kjs</command
> é o motor de ECMAScript/JavaScript para KDE. </para>
</refsect1>
